  "decision": "The upstream patch removes explicit OnPush metadata from modern menu and menu-item components and two modern test hosts. Owned legacy MatLegacyMenu and MatLegacyMenuItem retain their historical explicit OnPush metadata and owned markForCheck paths. Keep historical change-detection behavior; no conclusion is drawn that the modern peer default executes equivalently. Since the prior review, the primary barrel removed six addon aliases and the common-module re-export. The legacy module imports the same owned common class via its retained historical name; its imports, exports, providers and the behavior addressed here remain unchanged.",
  "source_conclusion_only": true,
